<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dillard Department raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dillard Department raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney upgraded Dillard Department Stores Inc to outperform from neutral, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details of the rating change were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Dillard said earlier it planned to buyback up to $300 million worth of its Class A common shares. Dillard also posted fourth quarter earnings of $0.98 a share, compared to $0.26 a share.</p>
<p>-- Dillard gained 1-3/4 to 29-7/8.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
